      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many people have how many snippets. The buckets tighten around the free limit (10) — a cluster at 7–9 means the limit is driving purchases; a cluster at 1–3 means people start and stop."
